.TH CIRCULATE 1 "October 2026" "circolate 0.1.0" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
circolate \- trackscript player and FL Studio/tracker converter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B circolate
[\fIFILE\fR]
.br
.B circolate
.I COMMAND
[\fIARGS\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B circolate
plays and converts tracker music, FL Studio projects, MIDI files, and
native
.B .trackscript
songs.  It opens a terminal UI when invoked without a subcommand, and
dispatches to a converter or diagnostic tool when a subcommand is given.

The player supports sample-based formats (WAV, FLAC, MP3, OGG, Vorbis),
SoundFont 2 synthesis, VST3 instrument and effect hosting, and the
trackscript effect shim system.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR play " [\fIFILE\fR]"
Play \fIFILE\fR, or open the player with an empty queue if no file is
given.  Accepts
.BR .trackscript ", " .tsz ", " .flp ", " .it ", " .mid ", " .midi ",
or a directory containing a trackscript.  If \fIFILE\fR is omitted and
.B play
was requested explicitly, a file picker is opened.

.TP
.BR export " [\fIFILE\fR] [\-o \fIDIR\fR]"
Convert a source file to trackscript.  Writes to
.B trackscripts/\fISTEM\fR/
by default.  Pass
.B \-a
or
.B \-\-archive
to write a single
.B .tsz
archive instead of a directory.

.TP
.BR dump " [\fIFILE\fR]"
Print the parsed structure of a file as JSON.

.TP
.BR test " [\fIFILE\fR]"
Run single-file diagnostics.

.TP
.BR check " [\fIPATH\fR]"
Recursively probe
.B .flp
files under \fIPATH\fR for missing plugins, samples, and SoundFonts.
Exits 1 if any file has unresolved dependencies.

.TP
.BR census " [\fIPATH\fR] [\-\-out \fIFILE\fR]"
Tally plugin names across all
.B .flp
files under \fIPATH\fR and write a
.B required_plugins.json
corpus census.

.TP
.BR measure " \fIPLUGIN\fR"
Measure a plugin's default-patch output level (RMS and peak, in dBFS).
.TP
.BR measure " \-\-only \fINAME\fR"
Measure a single installed plugin by name.
.TP
.BR measure " \-\-all [\-\-out \fIFILE\fR]"
Measure every plugin referenced by the fallback and registry tables,
writing a
.B plugins_inventory.json
to the user cache directory.

.TP
.BR plugins " [\-\-paths]"
List discovered VST3, VST2, LV2, and CLAP plugins.
.B \-\-paths
also prints the search directories.

.TP
.BR fetch " [\-\-dry] [\-\-only \fINAME\fR]"
Download missing fallback plugins into the user data directory.

.TP
.BR vst-smoke " \fIPLUGIN\fR [\fISTATE\fR]"
Load a VST3, play a sustained C4, and report peak and RMS levels.
Developer smoke test.

.TP
.BR sf2-smoke " \fIFILE.sf2\fR [\-\-bank \fIN\fR] [\-\-patch \fIN\fR] [\-\-note \fIN\fR] [\-\-list] [\-\-out \fIFILE.wav\fR]"
Play a note through the native SF2 engine.  Developer smoke test.

.TP
.BR list
List trackscripts under the user and repository trackscript directories.

.SH OPTIONS
Options accepted by
.B play
and
.BR export .
.TP
.BR \-\-render " \fIPATH\fR"
Render to WAV offline instead of opening the TUI.
.TP
.BR \-\-rate " \fIN\fR"
Sample rate for rendering (default 44100).
.TP
.BR \-\-start " \fISECS\fR"
Start playback at the given offset in seconds.
.TP
.BR \-\-samples\-dir " \fIPATH\fR"
Additional directory to search for samples when converting.
.TP
.BR \-\-sf2 " \fIPATH\fR"
Override the SoundFont referenced by MIDI or trackscript sidecars.
.TP
.BR \-\-skip\-native
Skip native FL Studio plugin channels during conversion.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-cache
Disable the sample decode cache.
.TP
.BR \-\-verify\-cache
Re-decode every sample and compare against the cached version; exits
non-zero on divergence.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-master\-fx
Bypass the master bus effect chain.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-watch
Disable live-reload for trackscript playback.
.PP
Global option:
.TP
.BR \-\-pause
Hold the terminal open on exit.  Intended for
.B .desktop
launchers.

.SH FILES
.SS Shipped (installed to /usr/share/circolate/)
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/fallbacks.json
Plugin and effect fallback table.  Defines which substitute plugins to
load when the original is not installed.
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/player_settings.json
Default theme, layout, and synesthesia configuration.
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/acquire.sh
Acquisition script invoked by
.B fetch
for fallback plugins that cannot be downloaded declaratively.
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/cover/
Fallback cover images, chosen at random for songs without their own.
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/icons/
Desktop entry icons.
.TP
.I /usr/share/circolate/native_fx/
Native effect LUT artifacts (currently empty; reserved).

.SS User configuration (overrides shipped defaults)
.TP
.I ~/.config/circolate/player_settings.json
Per-user theme, layout, and synesthesia overrides.
.TP
.I ~/.config/circolate/fallbacks.json
Per-user fallback table additions and overrides.

.SS User data
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/circolate/plugins/
VST3, LV2, and CLAP plugins downloaded by
.BR fetch .
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/circolate/soundfonts/
User-installed SoundFonts referenced by MIDI conversion.

.SS Cache (regenerable, safe to delete)
.TP
.I ~/.cache/circolate/covers/
Content-hashed cover image cache.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/circolate/plugins_inventory.json
Measured plugin output levels, used to compute fallback gains.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/circolate/required_plugins.json
Plugin corpus census.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/circolate/sf2/
Extracted SoundFonts.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/circolate/plugins/
Extracted embedded plugin bundles.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME, XDG_CACHE_HOME
Standard XDG base directories.  Each has a
.B circolate/
subdirectory.
.TP
.B CIRCOLATE_DATA_DIR
Override the shipped-data directory.  Useful for testing and packaging.
.TP
.B CIRCOLATE_CONFIG_DIR, CIRCOLATE_CACHE_DIR
Override the user config and cache directories.
.TP
.B FLP_DEBUG
Enable FLP conversion tracing.
.TP
.B SHIM_DEBUG
Enable effect shim resolution and parameter-setting traces.
.TP
.B TUI_DEBUG
Log every keyboard and mouse event the TUI receives.
.TP
.B VST3_SDK
Build-time only.  Path to a full VST3 SDK checkout.  If unset, the
vendored minimal subset under
.B vendor/vst3sdk/
is used.

.SH EXAMPLES
Play a converted song:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
circolate
.I trackscripts/nightlight4000/nightlight4000.trackscript
.fi
.RE
.PP
Convert an FL Studio project:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
circolate export
.I music/song.flp
.fi
.RE
.PP
Render to WAV without opening the TUI:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
circolate play
.I song.trackscript
.B \-\-render
.I out.wav
.B \-\-rate
.B 48000
.fi
.RE
.PP
Refresh the plugin measurement cache:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
circolate measure \-\-all
.fi
.RE
.PP
Check a corpus for missing plugins:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
circolate check music/flps
.fi
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
General error.  For
.BR check ,
non-zero indicates at least one file with unresolved dependencies.  For
.BR play \-\-verify\-cache ,
non-zero indicates cache divergence.

.SH SEE ALSO
The trackscript language reference is shipped as
.I /usr/share/doc/circolate/LANGUAGE.md
(or
.I docs/LANGUAGE.md
in the source tree).

.SH BUGS
Report bugs at the project repository.
